#. TRANSLATORS: this is the colorspace, e.g. red, green, blue
#. TRANSLATORS: this the ICC colorspace type
#: src/gcm-picker.ui:183 src/gcm-utils.c:67 src/gcm-viewer.c:593
msgid "RGB"
msgstr "RGB"

