msgstr "sRGB 覆盖率"

#. TRANSLATORS: e.g. what proportion of AdobeRGB is covered
#: src/gcm-viewer.c:689
msgid "Adobe RGB coverage"
msgstr "Adobe RGB 覆盖率"

